<chapter xml:id="ch-dual-problems" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Dual Problems</title>

<introduction>
<p>
In this chapter, we introduce a dual problem, which is related to the original (or primal) problem.  We will see why dual problems are important, especially in granting a <em>certificate</em>, ensuring that the solution we found for a primal problem is indeed optimal.
</p>
</introduction>
<xi:include href="sect-intro-dual.ptx" />
<xi:include href="sect-primal-dual-relationships.ptx" />
<xi:include href="sect-dual-certificates.ptx" />
</chapter>